      {
        "id": 115335,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-19T00:59:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It isn't designed to be used that way, but it could work.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I would follow the instructions on the card, and give it the Drone Deployment scenario power as a permanent power, so it would get one card from Omnitron-V's deck and Drone Deployment.</p><p>I might limit the drones to automaton and repair drones, just to keep it balanced.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With only 1 power card it can't have another attack and use drones very well. &nbsp;The drones get a whole turn for one of his actions, but with 2 actions and 1 power card spot you wouldn't be that powerful.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:47:29.165Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
