        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It isn&#39;t designed to be used that way, but it could work.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I would follow the instructions on the card, and give it the Drone Deployment scenario power as a permanent power, so it would get one card from Omnitron-V&#39;s deck and Drone Deployment.</p><p>I might limit the drones to automaton and repair drones, just to keep it balanced.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With only 1 power card it can&#39;t have another attack and use drones very well. &nbsp;The drones get a whole turn for one of his actions, but with 2 actions and 1 power card spot you wouldn&#39;t be that powerful.</p>",
